  "description": "Bring a little magic to your projects with this Cute Fairy Princess Clipart Set. It’s a sweet, storybook-style collection of cartoon girls in sparkly dresses, shimmering fairy wings and tiny crowns. The soft, colorful palette of pink, purple, teal, orange and gold gives every design a dreamy, fairytale feel that kids will love.\nWhat’s inside:\nPrincesses and fairies in a variety of dresses, hairstyles and poses\nFairy characters with delicate, glittery wings\nA cute unicorn and a smiling kitten wearing a crown\nA magic wand, a crescent moon scepter and a glass slipper\nA party hat, a love teapot, a teacup and a tiny seashell with a pearl\nStrawberries, roses, flower sprigs, a butterfly and a heart-shaped wand\nEach design as its own separate graphic, so you can mix, layer and resize freely\nFile formats included:\nPNG: transparent background, ready to place into your layouts\nSVG: scalable vector for Cricut, Silhouette and other cutting machines\nEPS: scalable vector for Adobe Illustrator and other design software\nPerfect for:\nPrincess and fairy birthday party invitations\nBaby showers and nursery decor\nKids’ classroom activities and storybook projects\nCake toppers, party favors and gift tags\nT-shirts, mugs and sublimation crafts\nStickers, planners, scrapbooking and greeting cards\nPlease note: This is a digital download. No physical item will be shipped.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring a little magic to your projects with this Cute Fairy Princess Clipart Set. It’s a sweet, storybook-style collection of cartoon girls in sparkly dresses, shimmering fairy wings and tiny crowns. The soft, colorful palette of pink, purple, teal, orange and gold gives every design a dreamy, fairytale feel that kids will love.</p>\n<p>What’s inside:</p>\n<p>Princesses and fairies in a variety of dresses, hairstyles and poses<br>\nFairy characters with delicate, glittery wings<br>\nA cute unicorn and a smiling kitten wearing a crown<br>\nA magic wand, a crescent moon scepter and a glass slipper<br>\nA party hat, a love teapot, a teacup and a tiny seashell with a pearl<br>\nStrawberries, roses, flower sprigs, a butterfly and a heart-shaped wand<br>\nEach design as its own separate graphic, so you can mix, layer and resize freely</p>\n<p>File formats included:</p>\n<p>PNG: transparent background, ready to place into your layouts<br>\nSVG: scalable vector for Cricut, Silhouette and other cutting machines<br>\nEPS: scalable vector for Adobe Illustrator and other design software</p>\n<p>Perfect for:</p>\n<p>Princess and fairy birthday party invitations<br>\nBaby showers and nursery decor<br>\nKids’ classroom activities and storybook projects<br>\nCake toppers, party favors and gift tags<br>\nT-shirts, mugs and sublimation crafts<br>\nStickers, planners, scrapbooking and greeting cards</p>\n<p>Please note: This is a digital download. No physical item will be shipped.</p>",
